 from its original purpose, maybe the First Angel was God-Machine. Or maybe not, because I think it has siblings outside of Solar System.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-25T12:32:46-08:00","id":322064,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yossarian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/320912-the-first-angel?p=321950#post321950\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Just a preview of my 2016 pitch to Onyx Path: <b>Metal Machine Music: Songs of the God-Machine</b><br /> <br /> That's the sorta thing you people want, right?<br /> <br /> ...right?</div> </div> </div> </div>Take all the monies.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-25T12:34:37-08:00","id":322066,"title":"","content":"Actually, it should not be a book, but a concept album. Otherwise I will be disappointed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-26T06:17:18-08:00","id":322751,"title":"","content":"I'm thinking the first angel was Lucifer. And he was large, like size of solar systems large. He's the reason angels are small and short lived. He fell and the GM is still waging a war against him and all the power it gave him. Sometimes he helps angels fall and works with demons, though his true goal is unknown.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/92-ramza","name":"Ramza","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar92_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-26T20:01:50-08:00","id":323359,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ramza</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/320912-the-first-angel?p=322751#post322751\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm thinking the first angel was Lucifer. And he was large, like size of solar systems large. He's the reason angels are small and short lived. He fell and the GM is still waging a war against him and all the power it gave him. Sometimes he helps angels fall and works with demons, though his true goal is unknown.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;See that nebula? That's where the fighting was the fiercest. Those aren't newborn stars. They're dying archangels and exploding demons in the service of the one we call Lucifer. Notice I said 'was.' The nebula is about 70 light years away from us. We're just seeing the climax of the battle that took place during World War II (tell me if that sounds like a mere coincidence to you). We have no idea whether the God-Machine won or lost Its war with Lucifer - nor even whether the war rages on. You turn yourself over to the Hunters, son, and you have no idea who or what you will be serving when the forges are done with you. Which side controls Earth now?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/browse.php?x=0&amp;y=0&amp;author=Eric%20Zawadzki\" target=\"_blank\">Onyx Path Freelancer</a></b> and former Deviant line developer.<br /> <br /> Deviant projects now on STV: <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/486079/Shallow-Graves?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Shallow Graves</b></a> and <a href=\"https://site.storytellersvault.com/product/550535/Black-Vans?affiliate_id=54122\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Black Vans</b></a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/Dayzdark\" target=\"_blank\">Updates and excerpts of current projects available here</a>.\u200b","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1094-eric-zawadzki","name":"Eric Zawadzki","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-27T23:26:54-08:00","id":324242,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ramza</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/320912-the-first-angel?p=322751#post322751\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm thinking the first angel was Lucifer. And he was large, like size of solar systems large. He's the reason angels are small and short lived. He fell and the GM is still waging a war against him and all the power it gave him. Sometimes he helps angels fall and works with demons, though his true goal is unknown.</div> </div> </div> </div>And here I thought all the inappropriate Tengen Toppa Gurren Lagann tie-ins went to Exalted. :P<br /> <br /> Probably the first angels ever weren't that different from the angels that are made today. Doesn't it say somewhere that the God-Machine has always been as technologically whatever as it is today?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I had a signature but now I don't but it won't let me leave this blank so yeah.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/199-yue","name":"Yue","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar199_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"61"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-27T23:43:09-08:00","id":324244,"title":"","content":"That's probably true-but that carries implications. Angels are both Infrastructure and parts of Occult Matrices. They serve as function and foundation.<br /> <br /> What functions and foundations do those original angels serve? Well, depending on how much you let Demon dictate reality, it could be responsible for even the most fundamental forces-electromagnetism, gravity, strong and weak forces.<br /> <br /> Oh hey, look, four again.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Bonus Points to whoever coordinates Michael, Gabriel, Raphael, and Uriel to them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 11-28-2014, 02:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-27T23:48:20-08:00","id":324249,"title":"","content":"That's actually a fantastic point. Then it raises the question of what, exactly, the laws of the universe were before these guys showed up?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I had a signature but now I don't but it won't let me leave this blank so yeah.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/199-yue","name":"Yue","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar199_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"61"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-28T00:00:12-08:00","id":324252,"title":"","content":"If you run on my theory about the God-Machine being, at it's core, the first wheel, you gotta figure at least the basics, whatever that is.<br /> <br /> Of course, my theory has zero basis in the text, and also faces the sticky situation of the God-Machine being able to handle temporal paradoxes-it could, theoretically, set up fundamental laws before it technically ever came about and never have to bother with how that entire cycle started, which is <i>also</i> part of my theory.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-28T07:49:13-08:00","id":324512,"title":"","content":"My interpretation is basically that God-Machine did not set up laws of universe, it just uses its loopholes and catches skillfully like a lawyer worth its salt. It did not create the system, it is a part of the system that has absurd skill at working it out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-28T09:11:47-08:00","id":324580,"title":"","content":"I go a step further in my games: the God-Machine didn't create the laws of the universe but It did <i>enforce</i> them, with angels of fire and steel as well as every occult physics exploit It could muster.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage the Awakening 2e Communal Homebrew Threads:<br /> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/966394-perils-of-the-path-post-your-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">Perils of the Path</a> - Other homebrew threads linked in the OP!<br /> <br /> Join us at the unofficial IRC channels on.irc.sorcery.net at #exalted and now #theonyxpath!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/451-kirby-jerusalem","name":"Kirby Jerusalem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar451_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"589"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-28T10:17:22-08:00","id":324623,"title":"","content":"I know the G-M <i>did</i> make some laws in my world, much to the frustration of things like the Exarchs. Which ones I haven't quite figured out yet, but it ties into the Embeds.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Actually, not the Principle, the Principle is not a sentience in my world.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-28T10:58:35-08:00","id":324666,"title":"","content":"If I use analogy from another franchise, what Angels, Demons and God-Machine may be in my personal interpretation somewhat similar to the gimmick of Necrons who don't alter laws of reality, just their technology is so advanced to the point they make Eldar's technology look crude. <br /> <br /> Would pay to see a duel between full powered Void Dragon and God-Machine.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-02T07:27:06-08:00","id":328183,"title":"","content":"In my world view, this world is an iteration in the God Machines great work to create perfect order. All started as Chaos which spawned the Machine somehow and it has since been imposing order to the best of its ability. It created the laws of physics but since it was working with Chaos they are far from perfect in its world view.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/92-ramza","name":"Ramza","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar92_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-02T17:58:44-08:00","id":328807,"title":"","content":"I like symmetry in almost everything. where there is a God-Machine there is the Devil-Organic. Yin and yang, G-M and Principle.<br /> <br /> The first Angels were micro-sized psychopomps for the massive first matrices, which are the &quot;fundamental&quot; rules that the Machine enforces for the Exarches. The Devil-Organic, Lucifer, the Principle, or Entropy, is the antithesis, the glitch, the error, free will, and self determination. If the Machine is an equation, Organic is the variable.<br /> <br /> My contribution to the Demon Album:<br /> The Machine builds falsely<br /> Walls, technology, artifice<br /> The Divine fire is free will","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2861-nyx","name":"Nyx","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2861_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-12T07:14:08-08:00","id":338050,"title":"","content":"I changed somewhat my interpretation of GM's origin under influence of Kalevala. A God-Machine was a gift from a heavenly blacksmith who supervised establishment of Fallen World and gave a &quot;a godly device, machine divine&quot; to first civilization (non-human) to distract them from seeking supernal truths by 'opening gates of plenty'. But such is the nature of life that the conflict is its primal instict (and communism is an utopia) so soon those beings started quarreling over its ownership. In the end God-Machine shattered, each shard spreading to distant corners of universe and even a shard still has impressive power over occult physics of Fallen World. Solar System's shard gained free will and started to exert it. There are more, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-12T13:01:19-08:00","id":338285,"title":"","content":"What if the signal was always present, perhaps being broadcast from the future, but the Machine wasn't? In the ancient days of the human past, what with tribalism and Irem and the world before cultivation, the Machine existed as signal scratching at the edge of reality. Astronomers and those who gazed to the heavens were most vulnerable, but others could occasionally hear it as well - mystics, the deformed, the outcasts of society. Over time, some of these outcasts grew to positions of power and influence, and began small cults and faiths that were dedicated to one of the many falsehoods the Machine uses to enslave men.<br /> <br /> With time, they constructed the first angel. The first angel was not as magnificent as you might expect - it was barely even functional, barely what it had to be. It began to bid mortals to construct more like it, using the powers the Signal had given it by design and function. It was excellent at hiding, excellent at helping the Signal be heard only by those meant to hear it.<br /> <br /> As human agriculture began in earnest, twelve thousand years ago, four such angels walked Earth.<br /> <br /> By the time the second phase was complete, roughly around 8,500BC, sixteen angels 'live' in service of the signal. They are building the future that attracts them with inevitable gravity.<br /> <br /> In the third phase, as the clock nears 6000BC, pockets of all five 'traditional' infrastructure types may be found in the strange and unnoticed corners of the world. The supernatural powers-that-be... the many forces that have guided men through history... don't recognize these small cults and operations for what they are, when they find them. They are as clueless now as they will ever be. The Machine does not fear them; they are its children, they are its story. It grows alongside them, swiftly, even as they believe they claim the world and mark it.<br /> <br /> By 4,000 BC, a full choir of 64 angels exists. The practice of modular loadouts is now feasible, with enough Matrixi hanging in storage for Angels to be given unique or specialized responsibilities. Advanced GM stations like Temporal Infrastructure exist, allowing for the harvesting of Matixi from a backup timeline or two.<br /> <br /> Visionaries look forward from that era with the fervent hope that the Signal will one day be so strong that more of the Machine will be real than unreal - that some tipping point exists, where more than half the schematic is completed and those that hear the Signal are beyond the Event Horizon, pulled inexorably towards the future where the God Machine Is All.<br /> <br /> It comes to pass. In the modern day, 16,384 angels have been constructed, with significantly varied levels of capability ranging from mere street people to angelic forces of cosmic destruction that can now challenge (and overcome) virtually any supernatural challenge on earth. Not that they intend to, of course - the Machine watches quietly as always, evading the attention of the world it controls even as a million monsters dance to its strings.<br /> <br /> And in the shadows, there? One might find her - the Hammersmith, the simple unit constructed so long ago. She is too primitive to be upgraded, but her survival is critical to some sort of underpinning Matrix or another, so the Machine continues to fund her with energy and materials. She labors on new angels, but works too slowly to be of use. What the Machine can now accomplish in seconds with advanced factory floors takes her weeks.<br /> <br /> And yet she always works with a smile, an expression of serenity on her face.<br /> <br /> Like she knows.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3386,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3386-piff","user":"Piff","date":". 12-12-2014, 04:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3386-piff","name":"Piff","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3386_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"442"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-13T09:01:53-08:00","id":339118,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/320912-the-first-angel?p=324623#post324623\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I know the G-M <i>did</i> make some laws in my world, much to the frustration of things like the Exarchs. Which ones I haven't quite figured out yet, but it ties into the Embeds.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Actually, not the Principle, the Principle is not a sentience in my world.</div> </div> </div> </div>Funny, see, in my cosmology, the G-M <i>is</i> the work of the exarchs. It's the repurposed remains of the shattered celestial ladder, explaining its power and its brokenness. Indeed, as a servant of the Exarchs, this also explains its apparent deference for and desire to maintain the bleak status-quo in the world of darkness.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3081-anachronistic-jam","name":"Anachronistic Jam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3081_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"211"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-15T16:31:32-08:00","id":341325,"title":"","content":"<b>Michael</b> is <b>Gravity</b>; he cast Lucifer from the heavens and into his long fall into Hell. <b>Destroyer</b>.<br /> <b>Uriel</b> is <b>Electromagnetism</b>; he is the Light of the God-Machine, who watches over thunder and terror. <b>Psychopomp.</b><br /> <b>Gabriel</b> is the <b>Strong Nuclear Force</b>; for he is the Strength of the God-Machine, the one that holds together the underpinnings of this world. <b>Messenger.</b><br /> <b>Raphael</b> is the <b>Weak Nuclear Force</b>; for he is heals and pulls together the base materials of this fallen world. <b>Guardian.</b><br /> <br /> I am actually really amused at how easily the archangels mapped to the Incarnations; there wasn't any massaging on my part.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-15T17:14:10-08:00","id":341386,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>amechra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/320912-the-first-angel?p=341325#post341325\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Michael</b> is <b>Gravity</b>; he cast Lucifer from the heavens and into his long fall into Hell. <b>Destroyer</b>.<br /> <b>Uriel</b> is <b>Electromagnetism</b>; he is the Light of the God-Machine, who watches over thunder and terror. <b>Psychopomp.</b><br /> <b>Gabriel</b> is the <b>Strong Nuclear Force</b>; for he is the Strength of the God-Machine, the one that holds together the underpinnings of this world. <b>Messenger.</b><br /> <b>Raphael</b> is the <b>Weak Nuclear Force</b>; for he is heals and pulls together the base materials of this fallen world. <b>Guardian.</b><br /> <br /> I am actually really amused at how easily the archangels mapped to the Incarnations; there wasn't any massaging on my part.</div> </div> </div> </div>Weirdly enough, for purposes unrelated to this I'd assigned Incarnations to the four most famous archangels and the only overlap with this set is Gabriel \u2014 I had Raphael as a Psychopomp and Uriel as a Destroyer.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-28T13:40:39-08:00","id":353080,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/320912-the-first-angel?p=341386#post341386\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Weirdly enough, for purposes unrelated to this I'd assigned Incarnations to the four most famous archangels and the only overlap with this set is Gabriel \u2014 I had Raphael as a Psychopomp and Uriel as a Destroyer.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can kinda see that... but I think Uriel would somehow be both a Destroyer and a Psychopomp, being somewhere between the two.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-28T13:49:18-08:00","id":353095,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>amechra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/320912-the-first-angel?p=341325#post341325\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Michael</b> is <b>Gravity</b>; he cast Lucifer from the heavens and into his long fall into Hell. <b>Destroyer</b>.<br /> <b>Uriel</b> is <b>Electromagnetism</b>; he is the Light of the God-Machine, who watches over thunder and terror. <b>Psychopomp.</b><br /> <b>Gabriel</b> is the <b>Strong Nuclear Force</b>; for he is the Strength of the God-Machine, the one that holds together the underpinnings of this world. <b>Messenger.</b><br /> <b>Raphael</b> is the <b>Weak Nuclear Force</b>; for he is heals and pulls together the base materials of this fallen world. <b>Guardian.</b><br /> <br /> I am actually really amused at how easily the archangels mapped to the Incarnations; there wasn't any massaging on my part.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Weirdly enough, for purposes unrelated to this I'd assigned Incarnations to the four most famous archangels and the only overlap with this set is Gabriel \u2014 I had Raphael as a Psychopomp and Uriel as a Destroyer.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm curious to hear the reasoning. Also love to see Satch's take on the forces discussion.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-28T15:01:34-08:00","id":353166,"title":"","content":"Michael is due to him helping the first Fall along with a flaming sword... I dunno, he just felt more Destroyer than anything else (though I'm curious to hear how Satchel assigned him.) Gravity was a joke related to the whole &quot;casting-down-Satan&quot; thing.<br /> <br /> Uriel is the Angel of the Book, who, in some traditions, is basically responsible for assigning you to the proper afterlife. Definitely Psychopomp... though he also has associations to thunder and fear, hence Satchel's Destroyer. One of his names translates to Light of God as well, so Electromagnetism is right there.<br /> <br /> Gabriel was the go-to archangel for delivering messages - couldn't really be anything else other than Messenger. Also translates to Strength of God, so Strong Nuclear Force.<br /> <br /> Raphael's big gig was the Book of Ruth, where he guided this chick named Ruth on a journey with some trials and tribulations. Hence Guardian (though Psychopomp works as well.) And... well... WNF was the only one left.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-28T15:41:30-08:00","id":353204,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>amechra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/320912-the-first-angel?p=353166#post353166\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Michael is due to him helping the first Fall along with a flaming sword... I dunno, he just felt more Destroyer than anything else (though I'm curious to hear how Satchel assigned him.)</div> </div> </div> </div>He's identified variously as the protector of Israel and the guardian of the Catholic Church, and he's not exactly the aggressor in the storied leadup to the sight of Satan Falling like lightning.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Gabriel was the go-to archangel for delivering messages - couldn't really be anything else other than Messenger. Also translates to Strength of God, so Strong Nuclear Force. </div> </div> </div>Insofar as I have a horse in the fundamental-forces race at all, I'd probably assign the Messenger the force we've built modern communications media off of and give the SNF to the Guardians on account of shared roles in holding things together.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Raphael's big gig was the Book of Ruth, where he guided this chick named Ruth on a journey with some trials and tribulations. Hence Guardian (though Psychopomp works as well.) And... well... WNF was the only one left. </div> </div> </div>His patronage includes lovers, happy meetings, travelers, and a long list of ills and their remedies, and the rest of his setup doesn't mesh with Destroyers as a direction to take his name of &quot;it is God who heals,&quot; so I gave him the traveler-gatherers. Thinking on it, I'd probably match Gravity to the Wheels, macroscopic accumulator that it is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-04T10:52:20-08:00","id":359316,"title":"","content":"I found this question very interesting, my choice for the first angel was the fundamental dimension of Time as well as the force Electromagnetism, whom I'd equate with Uriel from traditional angels. I went a little insane with the question, so I made my own thread so as not to derail this one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3036-desolatedolly","name":"DesolateDolly","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3036_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-04T13:52:55-08:00","id":359507,"title":"","content":"The first Angels were the Exarchs. Mages can just deal with it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3738-illuminated-minutia","name":"Illuminated Minutia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3738_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"280"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-04T15:28:02-08:00","id":359616,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Illuminated Minutia</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/320912-the-first-angel?p=359507#post359507\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The first Angels were the Exarchs. Mages can just deal with it.</div> </div> </div> </div>The first Angels weren't the Exarchs. They were, in fact, entirely unrelated to Mages.<br /> <br /> Mages can go <i>suck it</i>.<br /> <br /> (Just riffing; your idea works just fine.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}